<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Alaska Housing Corp bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Alaska Housing Corp bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for Alaska Housing Finance Corp general purpose housing bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to $10 million per firm on a first-come, first-served basis, MBIA said.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
